  PG["PostgreSQL [DATA]<br/>in: owner-scoped transaction<br/>out: users, sessions, state, nonce and usage rows"]
  FILES["Private versioned S3 [DATA]<br/>in: owner-tagged immutable file<br/>out: version and SHA-bound object reference"]
