  SAMPLE["Sample corpus [DATA · devrag]<br/>in: asset, statistic or trend query<br/>out: labelled illustrative fixtures"]
  PROVIDER["Model adapter [LIBRARY · OpenAI or Anthropic SDK]<br/>in: metered bounded model request<br/>out: result and usage or safe failure"]
  MEDIA["Media adapter [FUNCTION]<br/>in: approved image, video or audio request<br/>out: Sample or recorded provider provenance"]
